; Logical MXFP4 MoE, down half (the serving landing, 2026-09-10):
;   out[t, k, :] = w[t,k] · (W_dn[e(t,k)] · hidden[t,k,:] + b_dn[e(t,k)])   (per-route partials)
;   w[t, :]   = softmax(logits[t, e(t, 0..k)])   (over the SELECTED logits)
; Operands, in order:
;   hidden  [s, top_k, inter]            F32   (the gate/up half's result)
;   ids     [s, top_k]                   Int
;   logits  [s, experts]                 F32   (the router's output)
;   blocks  [experts, hidden, inter/2]   U8
;   scales  [experts, hidden, inter/32]  F8UE8M0
;   bias    [experts, hidden]            Bf16
; Metadata: hidden, top_k.
; Result: [s, top_k, hidden] F32 — the graph sums over k.
(constructor LogicalMoeDownMxfp4 (LogicalTensor LogicalTensor LogicalTensor LogicalTensor LogicalTensor LogicalTensor i64 i64) LogicalTensor)
